OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA band of
OL,6,Fincreasingly light and patchy rain
OL,7,Fwill move eastwards across the region
OL,8,Fduring the evening followed by clear
OL,9,Fspells and a few showers overnight.
OL,10,FMilder than last night with winds
OL,11,Feasing by dawn.
OL,12,
OL,13,CFriday:FIsolated showers first thing
OL,14,FFriday morning, but dissipating under
OL,15,Fa ridge of high pressure. This leaves
OL,16,Fbrighter spells in the afternoon,
OL,17,Fespecially in the west. Temperatures
OL,18,Fwill be near average.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
