OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FSome
OL,6,Fwet and windy weather returns later on
OL,7,FSaturday. Sunday looks rather cloudy
OL,8,Fwith patchy rain, though with lighter
OL,9,Fwinds. Staying mixed into next week
OL,10,Fwith bright spells and showers.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
